  "body": "4 bedrooms with 3.5 bathrooms & a garage\r\n\r\nWelcome to your dream home in the heart of East Auckland’s most sought-after neighbourhood! Imagine stepping into a sun-drenched, road-front residence tucked away on a quiet street, where every detail is designed for comfort, style, and effortless living.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new, double-storey masterpiece boasts four generous upstairs bedrooms, including two exquisite master suites,  a walk-in wardrobe, a private ensuite, and captivating local views. Whether you’re accommodating family or welcoming guests, everyone enjoys their own sanctuary.\r\n\r\nLove to entertain? The expansive downstairs layout is made for memorable moments: a separate lounge for intimate gatherings, a dedicated dining area for family feasts, and a chef-inspired kitchen featuring a gas 5-burner cooktop and a stunning island breakfast bar. Slide open the doors to your own deck – perfect for BBQs, celebrations, or simply soaking up the sun with friends.\r\n\r\nWith 3.5 elegant bathrooms (including a guest powder room), space and convenience are never compromised. The internal garage makes coming and going a breeze, while the clever floor plan ensures every family member feels right at home.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Education & Lifestyle\r\n\r\nEnjoy the peace of mind that comes with being in zone for some of Auckland’s top schools: Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College – all just moments away.\r\n\r\nWeekends are a delight with Half Moon Bay Marina nearby. Stroll to supermarkets, cafes, and restaurants, or catch the ferry for an easy commute to the CBD. Explore the golden sands of Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach, or discover the charm of Howick Village, all just a short drive from your door.\r\n\r\nPreview:\r\n\r\n-4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n-Separate lounge and dining area\r\n-Guest toilet and extra storage area\r\n-Outdoor deck and garage with internal access\r\n-2 master ensuite with own bathrooms and wardrobe\r\n-2 extra bedrooms with a common bathroom\r\n-Extra sitting area on the first floor\r\n-Double glazed windows and slider doors.\r\n-Healthy home compliant\r\n\r\nBe among the first to experience this exceptional new address. Don’t settle for ordinary. Step up to extraordinary.",
